  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p>수업에 어떻게 적용할 것인가 고민은 나중에,.^^</p><p>일단 기록만 남겨둡니다.&nbsp;</p><p>재미있게 써주세요^^</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/242FDD3F54FC8F3D11\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"540\" width=\"540\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"1425811401496.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_242FDD3F54FC8F3D119A46\"/></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.xportsnews.com/jenter/?ac=article_view&amp;entry_id=560672&amp;_REFERER=http%3A%2F%2Fsearch.naver.com%2Fsearch.naver%3Fwhere%3Dnexearch%26query%3D%25EB%259F%25B0%25EB%258B%259D%25EB%25A7%25A8%2B%25EC%25B5%259C%25EA%25B3%25A0%25EC%259D%2598%25EC%2582%25AC%25EB%259E%2591%2B%25EB%25B0%2580%25EB%258F%2584%26sm%3Dtop_hty%26fbm%3D1%26ie%3Dutf8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">http://www.xportsnews.com/jenter/?ac=article_view&amp;entry_id=560672&amp;_REFERER=http%3A%2F%2Fsearch.naver.com%2Fsearch.naver%3Fwhere%3Dnexearch%26query%3D%25EB%259F%25B0%25EB%258B%259D%25EB%25A7%25A8%2B%25EC%25B5%259C%25EA%25B3%25A0%25EC%259D%2598%25EC%2582%25AC%25EB%259E%2591%2B%25EB%25B0%2580%25EB%258F%2584%26sm%3Dtop_hty